# The CLAUDE.md / GEMINI.md aliases are symlinks to AGENTS.md, and Spec Kit's
# installer refuses an archive containing one:
#
#   Validation Error: Unsafe symlink in tar.gz archive: spec-kit-typo3-main/CLAUDE.md
#
# `safe_extract_archive` rejects symlinks outright, so with them in the tarball
# the documented `specify preset add --from …` install fails before anything is
# read. Keeping them out of the archive keeps both properties: an agent that
# opens CLAUDE.md in a clone still finds the rules, and the distributed archive
# is symlink-free.
#
# Do not remove these two lines to "clean up" — measured 2026-08-17, the install
# breaks immediately.
/CLAUDE.md export-ignore
/GEMINI.md export-ignore

# Not part of the preset a consumer installs. CHANGELOG.md stays in — the
# publishing guide lists it as part of the preset structure.
/.gitattributes export-ignore
